{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16314041","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16314041","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1631404101:1":{"text":"다들 조용히 해. 오늘은 엄청 중요한 일을 상의해야 하니까!","source_cn":"大家安静一下，咱们今天要商量大事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57B8465CF5126E2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1631404102:1":{"text":"왜 그래, 탄빵아? 말린 생선을 보관할 수 있는 새로운 장소라도 찾았어?!","source_cn":"什么大事啊煤球？是不是发现了新的小鱼干存放地点？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x651BF5BAEA80C267","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631404103:1":{"text":"그거보다 더 중요해! <style=\"highlight\">야옹 서비스 상회</style>를 열어서 두발짐승들을 위해 일하고 돈을 받아내는 거야!","source_cn":"比那还重要！我们要开一家<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FC479D2AA2DE007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631404104:1":{"text":"냐아... 두발짐승? 그 큰 녀석들을 위해 일하자고?","source_cn":"喵……两脚兽？那些大型生物？我们为他们提供服务？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26405F3528BBB795","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631404105:1":{"text":"맞아! 보니까 두발짐승들은 우리를 엄청 좋아하고, 항상 “돈”이라는 걸 가지고 다니더라고. 그러니까 우리의 재능으로 “돈”을 얻어내서 꿈을 이루는 거야!","source_cn":"没错！我观察到两脚兽似乎特别喜欢我们，而且他们总是带着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5438B9A83DB89129","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631404106:1":{"text":"예를 들면, 통조림을 끊임없이 먹는다거나 세상을 여행한다거나? 그리고... 전설의 말린 생선 공장을 가본다거나! 야옹!","source_cn":"比如吃不完的罐头？遨游世界？还有……参观传说中的鱼干工...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89BD3F80104943D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1631404107:1":{"text":"맞아. 중요한 건 우리가 두발짐승을 위해 어떤 일을 할 수 있냐는 건데...","source_cn":"对呀！重点是，我们需要想出能为两脚兽提供哪些服务……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB5B1B76C84F681D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1631404108:1":{"text":"음... 이불을 따끈하게 만들어줄 수 있어. 두발짐승들은 내가 발치에서 자는 걸 좋아하더라!","source_cn":"唔……我可以提供暖被窝服务，两脚兽似乎喜欢我在他们脚边睡觉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A0C80EC61F12885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1631404109:1":{"text":"쓰담쓰담 서비스도 해줄 수 있을 거 같아. 두발짐승들이 뭔가 마실 때 옆에서 쓰다듬을 잔뜩 받는 거지.","source_cn":"我们还可以提供猫咪陪伴服务，就是两脚兽喝奇怪液体时，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B4BB2971C0F188D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1631404110:1":{"text":"나는... 로브에 털을 잔뜩 묻혀 줄 수 있는데...","source_cn":"我……我可以免费赠送沾满毛球的法袍……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB9D0A6DC788A449","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1631404111:1":{"text":"음... 이건 안 돼. 기각!","source_cn":"咦……这条不行，作废！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BEAE4067AB7B419","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1631404112:1":{"text":"냐앙... 아무튼, 말린 생선을 위해!","source_cn":"喵呜……不管了，总之，为了小鱼干！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE35B94FDCF3DB1D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1631404113:1":{"text":"자유를 위해!","source_cn":"为了自由！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6A13EE464D6321E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1631404114:0":{"text":"꿈을 위해! 고양이 서비스 상회, 오픈이다!","source_cn":"为了梦想！猫猫服务商会，正式成立！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x566DBAA59F042A07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑猫煤球":{"text":"검은 고양이 탄빵이","source":"黑猫煤球","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:橘猫橙子":{"text":"치즈 고양이 오렌지","source":"橘猫橙子","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:白猫小白":{"text":"하얀 고양이 하양이","source":"白猫小白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":3}}